    "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Cinematic medium close-up, shallow depth of field, slow push-in. A middle-aged lighthouse keeper in a weathered yellow oilskin coat stands on a wet stone balcony at dusk, both hands gripping a rusted iron railing. Sea spray drifts across the frame and rain beads on the coat. The keeper turns to face the lens and speaks. <d>[English] The storm is coming. Secure the boats.</d> [Shot 2] At 00:03.500, cut to a low-angle wide shot of the lighthouse against a bruised purple sky, its lamp sweeping a hard beam through the rain as waves detonate against the rocks below."
